practical('login','Sign in to the partner dashboard.','01 / Owner or authorised operations user','login',['Open <a href="https://partner.hagzz.el7lm.com/partner/login">partner.hagzz.el7lm.com/partner/login</a> in a modern browser.','Enter the email and password allocated to your account.','Check the academy name after sign-in. Request activation if your details are not yet enabled.'],'The partner web account is separate from the customer app’s phone-based account. Never share the owner’s credentials.')
practical('guide','Follow the operating sequence.','02 / Find the right stage','guide',['Start with business setup: locations, coaches and programmes.','Move to registration: player records, groups and subscriptions.','Use daily operations for attendance, and finance for collection and reporting.'],'If a page is missing, ask the owner to review your role, branch access and academy type.')
practical('profile','Confirm the academy identity.','03 / Name, logo and contact details','profile',['Open the profile or academy settings available to your account.','Review the Arabic and English names, logo, contact details and sports.','Save and reopen the page to confirm the result.'],'Updating the partner profile alone does not prove that the academy is published in the customer app. Check the app separately.')
practical('location','Create the training location first.','04 / The venue used by programmes and sessions','location',['Choose training locations, then add a location.','Enter the venue details; select Qatar, the correct city and area where available.','Review activation and ownership fields, then save.'],'Use a genuine approved address in a live account. Make arrival instructions clear for guardians.')
practical('coach','Add the coach and sport.','05 / A clear operating record','coach',['Open coaches and add the required name, contact and sport.','Enter the agreed compensation details if your account uses these fields.','Confirm active status and save.'],'A coach record does not automatically create a sign-in account. Create team access separately where needed.')
practical('training','Create the training programme.','06 / What the academy offers','training',['Enter the programme name, description and sport.','Choose the coach and venue, then set age, level, capacity, session count and schedule.','Review the approved price, any discount and automatic session generation before saving.'],'Use the academy’s real schedule and approved prices. Do not generate duplicate sessions.')
practical('classes','Review the generated sessions.','07 / A programme is not an individual session','classes',['Open the sessions list after saving the programme.','Check dates, coach, venue and start/end times. Announce Qatar-local times.','Correct clashes or duplicates before sharing the schedule.'],'A programme describes the offer. A session is one scheduled occurrence. A group identifies the participating players.')
practical('student','Create the player and guardian record.','08 / Keep a single accurate player profile','student',['Add the player’s name, contact details, date of birth and required information.','Complete the guardian contact and relationship, plus necessary health information.','Save and search the list to check for a duplicate.'],'Collect only the information needed, with appropriate consent. This record does not automatically create a customer-app account.')
practical('group','Build the group and select its members.','09 / Connect the programme to its players','group',['Create a clearly named group for the age or ability level.','Link the programme, coach and sport; set the days, time and capacity.','Select the players as group members, save and review the member list.'],'A subscription alone is not a substitute for checking group membership. Verify membership before using the attendance register.')
practical('subscription','Record the subscription.','10 / Dates, amount and operating status','subscription',['Choose the player and group in a new subscription.','Set the agreed start/end dates, amount and subscription status.','Save and review the record before collecting money.'],'The subscription value is not cash collected. Record each real payment as a separate payment entry.')
practical('payment','Record the payment once.','11 / Trace each collection to its reference','payment',['Open the subscription and add the received amount, payment date and method.','Enter the receipt or transaction reference where applicable; save once.','Review collected and outstanding amounts before sending the receipt.'],'Illustrative QAR example only: 800 due, 500 received, 300 remaining. It is not a price quotation.')
practical('balance','Review the balance and issue the document.','12 / A record the team and guardian can understand','subscriptions',['Find the subscription and check total, collected, remaining and payment status.','Use the available invoice/print action; review the name, amount and dates.','Share the document through the academy’s approved process and retain the reference.'],'If money was debited but the payment is missing, check the transaction reference before collecting again.')
practical('session','Create the attendance session.','13 / The correct group on the correct day','attendance',['Open attendance and create a session.','Choose the group, training date and start/end times, then save.','Open the register and confirm the player list before recording statuses.'],'If a player is missing, review group membership, the selected group and the session date first.')
practical('scanner','Record attendance or scan the card.','14 / Read the result, not just the QR code','scanner',['For manual entry, open the register, choose the player’s status and save.','For scanning, open the scanner and allow camera access when requested.','Scan the card and confirm the player and session in the result. Use manual attendance if the camera is unavailable.'],'If a code is rejected, verify the card and player record. Never register another player as a workaround.')
practical('report','Close the day with a review.','15 / Attendance, collection and expenses','report',['Complete missing attendance statuses for the day.','Check collection and overdue balances; record actual expenses in the appropriate section.','Choose the relevant reporting period and reconcile it to payments and receipts.'],'A report only covers its selected period and recorded entries. Restrict financial access to the authorised team.')
